        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "From the same payments platform, we manage the entire payment process for our clients with the only difference being the type of payment offering selected to meet the needs of their customers, whether that be international or domestic.",
        "start_character": 43059,
        "end_character": 43294
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067540",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are unable to comply with the requirements applicable to our settlement activities, the payment networks may no longer allow us to provide these services and we would lose a substantial portion of our revenues.",
        "start_character": 72405,
        "end_character": 72621
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067540",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to international expansion, we are accelerating the growth of our in-country domestic accounts receivable business with the goal of both selling new solutions to existing clients and gaining new clients.",
        "start_character": 20808,
        "end_character": 21023
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067540",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have developed personalized communication channels (e.g., short message service (SMS), chat, email, text, or phone) to enhance our clients’ ability to engage with their customers through a digital-first user experience.",
        "start_character": 3152,
        "end_character": 3387
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067540",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also operate independently-deployable services that are critical to supporting verticals and reliability across operating environments.",
        "start_character": 46465,
        "end_character": 46603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067540",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe many legacy payment providers are hindered by limitations such as antiquated technology systems, insufficient solution and service offerings, poor user experiences, and unsatisfactory client and customer support.",
        "start_character": 55195,
        "end_character": 55418
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067540",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do so by leveraging our industry expertise and knowledge to develop a comprehensive view of our clients’ complex business challenges.",
        "start_character": 25346,
        "end_character": 25482
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067540",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We endeavor to enter into agreements with our FlyMates, consultants and contractors and with parties with whom we do business in order to acquire intellectual property rights developed as a result of service to Flywire, as well as to limit access to and disclosure of our proprietary information.",
        "start_character": 56222,
        "end_character": 56518
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067540",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067540-dc38c1c1c2e39bfc",
